UPSTREAM_REPO=https://github.com/Softeria/ms-365-mcp-server
UPSTREAM_COMMIT=621135a175cbd9b8b98d083bcaafeb5b7d083c64
UPSTREAM_TAG=v0.177.0
UPSTREAM_LICENSE=MIT
# Softeria's ms-365-mcp-server, the Microsoft 365 and Outlook.com MCP server
# the Assistant reaches a person's Microsoft mail, calendar, contacts and
# OneDrive through. Built from source rather than taken from npm or the
# project's image: its build downloads Microsoft Graph's OpenAPI documents
# unpinned and its generator with `npx -y`, so neither the published package
# nor the image can be rebuilt to the same bytes, and neither is signed. This
# build pins the source, the documents and the generator, and signs what it
# makes.
#
# Built natively per architecture (PLATFORM=linux/amd64, PLATFORM=linux/arm64)
# and joined into one tag by scripts/build.sh --merge; the ms365 workflow does
# both, then signs the joined digest. The tag is the upstream version, the
# build date and the workflow's run number, passed as IMAGE_TAG
# (0.177.0-2026.10.30.1), and the workflow refuses a tag that exists.
IMAGE_NAME=agentry-ms365
PLATFORMS=linux/amd64,linux/arm64
